  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-34163",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "To compute the dot product, we add up the products of corresponding components:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}b\\cdot c & ={b}_{1}\\cdot {c}_{1}+{b}_{2}\\cdot {c}_{2}+{b}_{3}\\cdot {c}_{3}+{b}_{4}\\cdot {c}_{4} \\\\  & =(-3)\\cdot (-4)+2\\cdot (-2)+1\\cdot 3+4\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =12-4+3+4 \\\\  & =15\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
